"up1_nzr_gq1","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p038","chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p038","text":"減宣者，楊人也。以佐史無害給事河東守府。衞將軍靑使買馬河東，見宣無害，言上，徴爲大廐丞。官事辨，稍遷至御史及中丞。使治主父偃及治淮南反獄，所以微文深詆，殺者甚衆，稱爲敢決疑。數廢數起，爲御史及中丞者幾二十歳。王温舒免中尉，而宣爲左内史。其治米鹽，事大小皆關其手，自部署縣名曹實物，官吏令丞不得擅搖，痛以重法繩之。居官數年，一切郡中爲小治辨，然獨宣以小致大，能因力行之，難以爲經。中廢。爲右扶風，坐怨成信，信亡藏上林中，宣使郿令格殺信，吏卒格信時，射中上林苑門，宣下吏詆罪，以爲大逆，當族，自殺。而杜周任用。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"減宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0020","start":20,"end":24,"surface":"衞將軍靑","kind":"person","person_id":"up1_nzr_gq1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0059","start":59,"end":62,"surface":"主父偃","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0104","start":104,"end":107,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0140","start":140,"end":144,"surface":"官吏令丞","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0172","start":172,"end":173,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":